  "description": "VOODOO BRAAG\n\nIn Voodoo, we believe that capable mountain bikes don’t need to break the bank. That’s why we envisioned the Braag with a high quality, tough frame with modern geometry to bring the excitement of current MTB sport to everyone.\n\nWe didn’t cut corners on the frame, but you shouldn’t think components won’t be up to the task. The Microshift Advent delivers modern and precise shifting even in tough terrain thanks to the clutch in the rear derailleur, within a sensible 9-speed package with enough range for climbing comfortably. If moving forward won’t be an issue, stopping is also covered by the precision and modulation of hydraulic brakes and big rotors.\n\nThe Braag is the perfect, and serious, MTB hardtail to start in the sports; and it can be a good and reliable second MTB for those already enthusiasts.\n\nReal MTB was never as accessible as with the Voodoo Braag.",
